  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Harnessing Intercultural Competencies for Peacebuilding and Social Cohesion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to harness intercultural competencies for promoting the respect of cultural diversity and equality and for fighting against discrimination and inner bias in post-conflict and peacebuilding contexts. Interdisciplinary expert consultations will be organised to further explore the potential of intercultural competencies development for conflict prevention, with the production of a new instrument or guide according to the recommendations.</narrative>
  </description>
